( group_truss_elasti_elongation_force_diagram (manual 6.773), F5 T5 U6:
  an odd number of values is an input error in GNU (the Professional
  02-08-2026 gives force 0 without a message).
  EXPECTED_ERROR: Error: group_truss_elasti_elongation_force_diagram needs pairs
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 1
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0.
node 2 2.
element 1 -truss 1 2
group_type 0 -truss
group_truss_area 0 1.
group_truss_elasti_elongation_force_diagram 0 0 0 0.01
bounda_dof 1 1 -velx
bounda_time 1 0.
bounda_dof 2 2 -velx
bounda_time 2 0.028
control_timestep 0 1. 1.

end_data
